WEBVTT

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:07.270
Garbage collection schedule

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.270
There we go.

00:00:09.470 --> 00:00:11.280
It's so cold today.

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.530
<i>My glasses adorn my face.</i>

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:19.930
<i>For glasses, go to the Paradise of Glasses.</i>

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.290
Finally done.

00:00:32.750 --> 00:00:34.770
Good morning, Pochi.

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:40.180
Huh? Where's Sora-kun?

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:45.080
What a cute lunch.

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:46.940
Good on him.

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:50.440
<b>Apple</b>

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.440
<b>Dog food</b>

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:50.440
<b>Shirataki</b>

00:00:54.850 --> 00:00:56.320
Oh, Kaede-san.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.330
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:00.960
Did you not have enough money for food?!

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.510
Did you have unexpected expenses?!

00:01:02.510 --> 00:01:05.330
I think it's a good thing that you're frugal...

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:10.910
but you don't need to try so hard 
that you wind up eating dog food!

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:15.720
I'm not eating dog food.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.590
I'll introduce you.

00:02:53.590 --> 00:02:54.670
Um...

00:02:56.490 --> 00:02:58.360
He's Mii-kun.

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.990
A mummy?

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:04.240
My dad sent him to me.

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:06.900
He was in this huge casket.

00:03:08.140 --> 00:03:10.030
A c-casket?!

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.510
Where's the casket?!

00:03:18.590 --> 00:03:20.160
This is it!

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.920
This is what I've always wanted!

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:23.890
Thank you, Nii-san!

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:27.480
I never knew that was a 
gift for you, Kaede-san.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:30.770
Whoa, look at the time!

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:36.930
Sorry, Kaede-san, can we wait until 
tonight to talk about Mii-kun?

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:38.060
I'm going to school.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.280
Oh, okay.

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:41.150
Huh?

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:46.670
Sora-kun?!

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.920
<i>It's been a long time since I've had a cold.</i>

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.620
<i>I hope no one else caught it.</i>

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.920
I want water.

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:10.180
He kicked us out, huh?

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:14.620
Don't be so nervous.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:19.570
I've met species like 
you a few times before.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:24.700
I'm happy to have such a 
cute addition to the family.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:40.510
Nice to meet you.

00:04:42.970 --> 00:04:44.590
<b>Sora-kun Cordless
Incoming Call</b>

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.530
Hello? Sora-kun?

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:49.300
<i>Sorry, Kaede-san...</i>

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:53.180
<i>Could you bring some water to my door?</i>

00:04:53.570 --> 00:04:55.590
<i>I can't move.</i>

00:04:58.410 --> 00:04:59.980
Sora-kun, are you all right?

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.840
Y-You can't move?!

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.970
I didn't realize it was so bad!

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.860
Sora-kun, open up!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.370
Open up the door!

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:10.870
Sora-kun! Sora-kun!

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:13.360
I'm fine, I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.360
Please, open the door, Sora-kun!

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:15.290
Back off, or you'll catch my cold.

00:05:14.220 --> 00:05:16.030
Please, open the door!

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:17.930
Why do you think I called you?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.880
Sora-kun! Sora-kun!

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:23.980
Is she gone?

00:05:31.500 --> 00:05:33.480
I'll be perfectly safe with this.

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:34.670
Don't worry.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:36.620
You scared me so bad.

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:39.090
I thought I was going to have a heart attack.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:40.650
I've made arrangements for Mii-kun, too.

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:44.900
Wait a sec, is he all right?!

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:51.030
He still kicked us out.

00:05:53.660 --> 00:05:56.510
We can't stay bummed forever.

00:05:56.510 --> 00:05:58.420
I'll make him some porridge.

00:06:00.890 --> 00:06:03.170
Stay with Pochi, all right?

00:06:05.150 --> 00:06:07.150
This is Sora-kun's handkerchief.

00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.290
That'll keep you warm.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.860
Too hot...

00:06:34.400 --> 00:06:35.880
I'm drenched in sweat.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.430
Gross.

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:38.710
I want to get changed.

00:06:42.820 --> 00:06:44.960
Mii-kun! Mii-kun!

00:06:46.900 --> 00:06:48.720
Kaede-san, what's wrong?

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:50.220
Sora-kun!

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.610
Mii-kun...

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:55.720
Mii-kun... He looks like a mummy.

00:06:57.290 --> 00:07:00.860
He seems to have started crying 
while I was making porridge.

00:07:00.860 --> 00:07:03.010
He shriveled away.

00:07:03.010 --> 00:07:05.420
I tried giving him water and 
comforting him, but it was no good.

00:07:05.420 --> 00:07:08.110
He wouldn't let go of your handkerchief.

00:07:09.270 --> 00:07:12.870
Do you mean he shriveled 
up from crying too much?

00:07:13.720 --> 00:07:15.660
Is that what was happening before, too?

00:07:17.860 --> 00:07:20.910
He's been lonely without me?

00:07:28.380 --> 00:07:29.600
What is that?

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:31.730
Jeez.

00:07:32.400 --> 00:07:34.450
You're so hopeless.

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.660
Sora-kun!

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.690
Your fever!

00:07:44.780 --> 00:07:45.690
Thank goodness.

00:07:46.330 --> 00:07:48.880
Mii-kun's back to normal.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:49.690
Yeah.

00:07:49.980 --> 00:07:51.340
What shall we do?

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:53.760
He'll shrivel up if he's not with you.

00:07:57.250 --> 00:07:59.200
It's okay, Kaede-san.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:01.470
Can I just ask you to take care of Pochi?

00:08:01.470 --> 00:08:03.460
Okay, got it.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.260
It's nice and cold.

00:08:11.660 --> 00:08:13.090
Sorry, Mii-kun.

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.440
I can't play with you right now.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:41.370
Are you all right, Kashiwagi?

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.280
Tazuki?

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:45.160
Yeah.

00:08:46.110 --> 00:08:48.170
Kaede-san sent me a message.

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.920
I came to check on you.

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:55.130
She handed me this as soon as I got here.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:56.240
Yeah.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:57.730
Sorry about that.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:04.450
Kaede-san locked herself in 
her room with urgent work.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:06.150
She left me with porridge and medicine.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:07.760
Thanks.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.590
Is there anything else you need?

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:12.010
I'm good.

00:09:12.010 --> 00:09:15.370
That aside, Tazuki, can you do me a favor?

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:16.910
Sure, what is it?

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:20.910
It's almost dinner time 
for Pochi and Mii-kun.

00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.040
That's what you're worried 
about at a time like this?

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.080
Mii...

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:34.140
Take care of Kashiwagi for me.

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.910
That feels good.

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:29.820
What's wrong, Mii-kun?

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:31.020
You're soaked.

00:11:32.160 --> 00:11:32.960
Morning.

00:11:39.190 --> 00:11:42.330
I have plenty of time to play 
with you today, Mii-kun.

00:11:44.610 --> 00:11:45.470
Hm?

00:11:50.850 --> 00:11:54.860
It's Scary When Someone You Care About Gets Sick

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.860
<i>So, yeah...</i>

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:01.110
One moment you're sick, and now Mii is?

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.410
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:05.120
Kashiwagi

00:12:02.410 --> 00:12:04.340
<i>Mii-kun's been sneezing the whole time.</i>

00:12:04.340 --> 00:12:05.120
<i>He seems miserable.</i>

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:07.100
What about Kaede-san?

00:12:07.100 --> 00:12:10.370
<i>She's gone all day doing her modeling work.</i>

00:12:10.790 --> 00:12:11.700
I see.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:14.510
I know you're worried about Mii,

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:17.130
but you had a 39 degree 
fever until yesterday.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:18.560
Be sure to get some rest.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:19.860
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:12:26.590 --> 00:12:28.210
Morning, Kamiya.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:29.200
Morning.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.600
Huh, is Kashiwagi still home sick?

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:32.390
Yeah.

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.580
Ah.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:35.940
Tell him to take care.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:36.730
Yeah.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:37.440
Later.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:42.010
And I got this insane picture...

00:12:42.010 --> 00:12:43.450
Yeah, good for you.

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:45.420
Wanna see? You wanna see, right?

00:12:49.910 --> 00:12:51.940
Mii-kun are you okay?

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:52.790
Are you cold?

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:57.540
What?

00:12:59.330 --> 00:13:00.300
Over there?

00:13:01.410 --> 00:13:04.100
That's outside, Mii-kun.

00:13:04.100 --> 00:13:05.430
It's the backyard.

00:13:07.180 --> 00:13:10.660
You can't. You have a cold.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.810
It's cold. You'll get even worse.

00:13:20.260 --> 00:13:23.360
<i>He's never this desperate to go outside.</i>

00:13:24.800 --> 00:13:25.810
All right.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:27.400
One second, Mii-kun.

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:30.560
Here.

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:32.510
How's that?

00:13:32.510 --> 00:13:34.550
I think you can stand the cold now.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:43.300
So cold!

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:44.790
It's still too cold.

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:46.670
Let's go inside, Mii-kun.

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.850
Mii-kun? What's wrong?

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:01.510
Um...

00:14:01.510 --> 00:14:02.600
Mii-kun?

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:04.060
What are you doing?

00:14:04.060 --> 00:14:05.240
Do you want to dig a hole?

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:11.920
<i>Uh oh.</i>

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:14.750
<i>I have no idea what he's trying to do.</i>

00:14:17.090 --> 00:14:18.250
Okay, okay.

00:14:18.770 --> 00:14:21.640
I'll bring a shovel so you can dig.

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:31.390
Th-Thanks, Pochi.

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:35.270
Mii-kun, Pochi dug you a hole.

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:04.080
What? What?! <i>What</i>?!

00:15:05.140 --> 00:15:07.660
<i>Wh-What am I supposed to do?</i>

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:09.440
Mii-kun?

00:15:09.980 --> 00:15:11.360
Hey.

00:15:13.960 --> 00:15:16.390
<i>I guess I'll just wait until he comes out.</i>

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:21.190
So cold.

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:23.740
What, Pochi?

00:15:28.960 --> 00:15:31.200
Nothing's written about it.

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:35.200
<i>Mii-kun...</i>

00:15:39.940 --> 00:15:41.660
Don't worry, Pochi.

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:44.420
Let's wait for Mii-kun to come out.

00:15:51.900 --> 00:15:52.940
Tacchan.

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:54.820
Tacchan?

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:56.850
Are you eating lunch by yourself?

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:59.180
Yeah, I guess.

00:15:59.180 --> 00:16:00.310
Oh.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:02.490
Sora-chan's still sick, huh?

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:04.160
I wonder if it's bad.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:05.640
I'm worried.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:07.360
I hope he gets better soon.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:08.570
Yeah.

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:09.540
See you.

00:16:09.540 --> 00:16:10.230
Yeah.

00:16:12.780 --> 00:16:16.300
<i>Knowing Kashiwagi, he's probably...</i>

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:31.660
I'm sure he'll come out soon.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.250
So don't worry.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:38.880
Don't worry.

00:16:40.090 --> 00:16:41.170
Don't worry.

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:51.010
What do I do?

00:16:51.370 --> 00:16:52.650
Mii-kun...

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.410
Oh, no! It's hurt.

00:17:00.560 --> 00:17:01.790
Leave it.

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.710
It's barely alive.

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.290
You know it's not going to make it.

00:17:07.570 --> 00:17:09.230
What's gotten into you, Tazuki?

00:17:09.230 --> 00:17:11.170
You've never said anything like that before.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:13.230
You picked it up when it's about to die.

00:17:13.230 --> 00:17:14.880
It's going to die right in front of you!

00:17:14.880 --> 00:17:17.180
You're going to be the one suffering!

00:17:27.750 --> 00:17:28.910
Listen, Sora.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:32.180
All living things eventually die.

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:34.320
It's not your fault.

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:38.450
But it's sad to see a life be lost, isn't it?

00:17:39.250 --> 00:17:42.650
Cry lots, and grieve for it lots.

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.970
I thought a mummy would be okay.

00:17:48.050 --> 00:17:50.340
I didn't think he'd catch the cold.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:52.260
If...

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:55.050
If Mii-kun di—

00:18:01.540 --> 00:18:02.210
Mii!

00:18:02.210 --> 00:18:03.220
Mii-kun!

00:18:03.990 --> 00:18:05.830
Are you all right, Mii-kun?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:06.780
Are you alive?

00:18:16.740 --> 00:18:18.940
Are you... hungry?

00:18:25.270 --> 00:18:27.500
Looks like you're all better.

00:18:27.910 --> 00:18:28.750
Huh?

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:31.500
<i>He was covered in dirt until just now.</i>

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.620
<i>He's kind of clean all of a sudden.</i>

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:39.630
I'm home.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:43.670
I'm glad you and Mii-kun are both better.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:48.020
<b>Tofu</b>

00:18:43.670 --> 00:18:46.000
You can't let your guard down, though.

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:48.020
<b>Shirataki</b>

00:18:45.180 --> 00:18:48.020
<b>High-quality
domestic beef</b>

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.020
You need to gain some strength.

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:50.400
So let's have sukiyaki tonight.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:52.450
Thanks, Kaede-san.

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:55.040
Let's get you a lot of shirataki.

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:57.750
Can I help with anything?

00:18:57.750 --> 00:18:58.890
No, no.

00:18:58.890 --> 00:19:00.660
You just have a seat.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:03.030
I'm just going to make it really quickly.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:04.910
No, not the glasses!

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:13.420
What about my glasses, my adorable Sora-kun?

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.550
<i>Here we go, it's Kaede-sama!</i>

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:18.000
Oh, no.

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:21.100
I can't control my overflowing 
love for you, Sora-kun.

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:22.580
You don't need to be overflowing.

00:19:22.580 --> 00:19:24.050
Put it away! Put it away!

00:19:24.380 --> 00:19:26.200
Sora-kun...

00:19:31.070 --> 00:19:32.060
Oh?

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:35.830
What an adorable hero, like a rice cake.

00:19:35.830 --> 00:19:38.070
I want to eat you up.

00:19:38.070 --> 00:19:39.570
Mii-kun, run!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:43.200
Smooch.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:46.350
Tazuki!

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:47.950
Oh, Tazuki-kun.

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:51.470
I missed you, my sweet boy.

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:54.110
Now, give me a greeting embrace.

00:19:54.110 --> 00:19:55.600
H-Huh?

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:59.210
So how are you going to greet me again?

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:08.220
I'm really sorry!

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:12.360
Kaede-san, is there anything you can 
do about your change in personality

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:14.140
when you put on glasses?

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:17.710
There's nothing I can do about it.

00:20:17.710 --> 00:20:20.350
She needs it for work.

00:20:20.350 --> 00:20:23.240
But please don't wear glasses at home.

00:20:23.450 --> 00:20:25.060
I'm sorry.

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.870
You should eat it before it gets stiff.

00:20:33.110 --> 00:20:33.960
Okay.

00:20:35.420 --> 00:20:37.120
How's Mii doing?

00:20:37.750 --> 00:20:39.560
Oh yeah, get this.

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:42.250
Mii-kun fights the cold in the dirt.

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:43.750
Do you still have a fever?

00:20:43.750 --> 00:20:45.290
I swear!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.480
He was all better when he came out.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:49.510
That's amazing.

00:20:49.510 --> 00:20:52.760
Amazing? More like way too mysterious.

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:55.820
Okay, get home safe.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:58.290
What?

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:01.090
Nah, knowing you,

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:06.030
I thought you'd be thinking it's 
your fault that Mii got sick.

00:21:08.040 --> 00:21:11.500
I was worried that you might 
have lost your confidence.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:14.390
Looks like I had nothing to worry about.

00:21:19.190 --> 00:21:21.670
Yeah, I think you have 
nothing to worry about.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:23.920
All right. Good.

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:25.940
Thanks for caring about me.

00:21:26.330 --> 00:21:27.300
It's fine.

00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:32.460
You're like family to me.

00:21:40.440 --> 00:21:43.190
<i>He can recover from a 
cold by being in the dirt.</i>

00:21:43.190 --> 00:21:45.200
<i>And like Tazuki said before...</i>

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:48.620
I can't find the end of his bandage.

00:21:49.180 --> 00:21:51.450
<i>I really can't find the end.</i>

00:21:51.990 --> 00:21:54.960
<i>There should be an end to 
his bandage if he's a mummy.</i>

00:21:56.860 --> 00:21:58.400
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:03.280
<i>there's still a ton of things 
I don't know about Mii-kun.</i>

00:22:05.880 --> 00:22:07.380
Observations

00:22:17.330 --> 00:22:18.270
Sniffle...

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:54.280
It turns out Mii-kun can 
go up and down the table.

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:56.760
I wonder how he's hanging on.

00:23:57.110 --> 00:23:59.870
Mummies sure are strange.

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:04.710
Next Episode 
You Can't Play Tag by Yourself,
and It's Fine to Play With Others

00:24:00.610 --> 00:24:01.920
<i>How to Keep a Mummy</i>.

00:24:01.920 --> 00:24:03.510
See you next time.

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:08.000
<b>See you next time!</b>
